        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electric motor, for electric scooter</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electric motor, for electric scooter
This dataset describes the production of an electric motor suitable for an electric scooter. The entries are given on a function of kg of device. The original data was collected for a device of approximately 5.8kg. The dataset is based on direct inspection of existing commercial devices of current technology.;
UUID: 460f10ae-9ff6-3c63-86b2-2a93d972c9ac
The dataset takes as input the various marterials and energy resources required for the production of the electric motor. The dataset returns the electric motor and production waste materials as by-products.
Location: Unspecified
Technology: Unspecified
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 4500000 kg
Sampling: Direct inspection of a typical device of common technology. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_460f10ae-9ff6-3c63-86b2-2a93d972c9ac.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
